OL,3,AProtesters disperse after blocking
OL,4,Acontentious Orange Order parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of protesters blocked a road
OL,7,Fin Portadown on Sunday after a
OL,8,Fcontentious Orange Order parade was
OL,9,Fgiven late-night clearance to march
OL,10,Fdown it for the first time in almost 30
OL,11,Fyears.
OL,13,FFollowing a series of legal challenges,
OL,14,Fa ruling by the Parades Commission
OL,15,Fpermitting the Drumcree parade down the
OL,16,Fmainly-nationalist Garvaghy Road was
OL,17,Fupheld in an "unprecedented" sitting of
OL,18,Fthe High Court in Belfast.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
