OL,3,AProtesters disperse after blocking
OL,4,Acontentious Orange Order parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland's First Minister
OL,7,FMichelle O'Neill joined the protesters,
OL,8,Fwhile members of the Orange Order and
OL,9,FDemocratic Unionist Party (DUP)
OL,10,Fpoliticians gathered about a mile away,
OL,11,Fwaiting for the road to clear.
OL,13,FDUP leader Gavin Robinson said O'Neill
OL,14,Fwas breaking the law by protesting.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
